  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 414.02 Water Event or Slalom Course Permit Application",
  "priorExpiration": "2004-12-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 414.02 Water Event or Slalom Course Permit Application.\n\n(a) An applicant for a permit to conduct a water event or slalom course shall provide the commissioner with the following:\n\n(1) Name, address, date of birth, telephone number and cellular telephone number, if available, of the applicant;\n\n(2) The type of water event;\n\n(3) The name of the water event, if applicable;\n\n(4) The name of the public water on which the water event will be conducted;\n\n(5) The name of the town or city where the public water is located;\n\n(6) The date(s) the water event will be conducted;\n\n(7) The start and end time of the water event each day it is conducted;\n\n(8) A brief description of the water event;\n\n(9) The number of participants in the water event;\n\n(10) A map or sketch of the water event area, including the direction \"north\" as a reference; and\n\n(11) Signature of the applicant and date signed.\n\nSource. #5448, eff 8-24-92; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8107, EMERGENCY, eff 6-22-04, EXPIRES: 12-19-04; ss by #8172, eff 9-21-04; (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading) renumbered by #9544 (formerly Saf-C 413.02); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c400.html"
